BT 1 0 0 1 0 33.8 Tm /F1 8.2 Tf 10.5 TL (The ACEest Flask application \(app.py\) is version-controlled in GitHub. The demonstrated CI/CD flow uses Jenkins \(SCM polling\), Ruff linting, Pytest) Tj T* (in a Docker test image, runtime image build and smoke test, SonarQube analysis/Quality Gate, Docker Hub publication and Kubernetes deployment) Tj T* (on Minikube. GitHub Actions also runs lint, test and Docker checks on pushes and pull requests. The Jenkinsfile defines the pipeline; the multi-stage) Tj T* (Dockerfile separates test and runtime stages. The runtime uses Gunicorn as a non-root user \(UID 10001\) and exposes a /health endpoint.) Tj T* ET
