BT 1 0 0 1 0 33.8 Tm 10.5 TL /F2 8.2 Tf 0 0 0 rg (Limitations.) Tj /F1 8.2 Tf ( The canary is verified by endpoint inclusion rather than weighted traffic distribution. Shadow evidence represents the implemented) Tj T* (test/replay workflow, not production-grade live traffic mirroring. A and B use the same image and are separate endpoints; automatic A/B routing is) Tj T* (not available because the legacy proxy is CrashLoopBackOff. The local Minikube cluster is reachable from the VM; its NodePort address is) Tj T* (environment-specific.) Tj T* ET
